      "writtenOn": "2023-05-05T19:52:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "could we just use android here? \n\n`//build/bazel/product_variables:my_namespace__my_bool_variable__android` would be a specialization of android and thus selected over just android, and then android would be sufficient here?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1349,
        "startChar": 8,
